      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00303:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "The ball-and-stick model, Fischer projection, and Haworth projection of alpha-D-glucopyranose and beta-D-glucopyranose. Formation of cyclic hemiacetal creates an additional chirality center giving two diastereomeric forms designated as alpha and beta."
